      "status": "generated",
      "prompt": "Edit the supplied source photograph into Retro Star Portrait Collage / 复古星星人像拼贴. Produce one complete portrait 3:4 image, at least 1086 by 1448 pixels.\nObserved source: 一位虚构成年短发男性站在灰墙前，穿深蓝开衫、浅灰T恤、褐色长裤和白鞋；右手握牵引绳连接右下方棕白狗，人物全身、狗的身体与脚均完整可见，姿势自然，未见文字标记。\nMedium: A grayscale photographic portrait cutout layered over saturated paper, with oversized patterned starbursts and tactile cut-letter tiles.\nCreate a portrait 3:4 poster with the complete source person and accompanying animal as the dominant central photographic cutout.\nConvert cutout subjects to crisp grayscale photography, keeping facial identity, clothes, pose and animal markings recognizable.\nSurround the cutout with a narrow uneven cream-paper edge and a slightly offset dark paper underlayer.\nUse a clean saturated lime paper field with pink and cream accent papers; keep the photographic subjects grayscale.\nPlace one oversized irregular patterned starburst behind the upper body, plus two smaller stars away from faces and paws.\nFill the large star with sparse contrasting speckles; use subtle paper fibers and shallow contact shadows, not heavy aging.\nSet the supplied short phrase on separate cream cut-paper letter tiles; arrange them with modest angle changes near the lower third.\nKeep the leash continuous and correctly attached; paper and lettering must not hide the person, dog or their connection.\nKeep the cut-paper layers distinct and the background uncluttered; add no external frame, additional person, logo or watermark.\nPreserve: Preserve the source person’s identity, pose, clothing, limbs and complete silhouette. Preserve the animal’s body shape and markings, and the real connection of the leash. Reposition and uniformly scale the joined source group; do not change its internal proportions or invent accessories.\nAvoid: Illustrated or beautified faces, altered clothes, clipped feet or paws, missing leash, duplicate subjects. Busy sticker collections, glossy plastic stars, excessive grunge, thick fake 3D shadows or copied source poster text.\nSample text supplied for this example only: {\"title\":\"SIDE BY SIDE\"}\nReturn only the finished image.",
      "prompt_sha256": "6e5d5475bdd5a886b7990fb65e46c620bb601dfc500bf14d257831bd1e7f25ae",
      "prompt_redacted": false,
